WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.279 --> 00:00:15.960
led Mandy to another room in the palace.

2
00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:21.921
Suddenly, Mandy noticed a familiar figure holding some flowers.

3
00:00:21.941 --> 00:00:25.843
"Vinnie!" she shouted.

4
00:00:27.123 --> 00:00:28.823
He turned around and smiled.

5
00:00:28.843 --> 00:00:32.061
"Mandy!" called Vinnie.

6
00:00:33.141 --> 00:00:34.983
He ran over to his sister.

7
00:00:36.243 --> 00:00:39.025
Mandy introduced Vinnie to her new friend.

8
00:00:39.045 --> 00:00:42.288
"You're Princess Anastasia?"

9
00:00:42.688 --> 00:00:43.328
asked Vinnie.

10
00:00:43.348 --> 00:00:47.831
"Yes, but just call me Anya," she said.

11
00:00:49.272 --> 00:00:50.373
Vinnie turned white.

12
00:00:51.494 --> 00:00:55.437
But before Mandy could say anything, a voice interrupted.

13
00:00:55.457 --> 00:01:00.240
"Your highness, the Fabergé egg is here.

14
00:01:01.672 --> 00:01:03.933
We will begin the celebration soon."

15
00:01:03.953 --> 00:01:07.454
"Rasputin!" thought Vinnie.

16
00:01:07.474 --> 00:01:13.835
"Go about your duties," ordered Rasputin, pointing to Vinnie and Mandy.

17
00:01:15.196 --> 00:01:21.057
Then in a kinder voice, to Anastasia he said, "Go to your parents, Princess."

18
00:01:22.698 --> 00:01:25.218
"Rasputin, you can't tell me what to do!"

19
00:01:25.579 --> 00:01:26.799
cried Anastasia.

20
00:01:26.819 --> 00:01:30.560
"You will listen, little one," he said.

21
00:01:31.888 --> 00:01:33.849
"I am your mother's closest advisor.

22
00:01:34.329 --> 00:01:34.909
Obey me!"

23
00:01:36.270 --> 00:01:40.111
Anastasia stamped her feet and walked off with Rasputin.

24
00:01:41.552 --> 00:01:45.874
"Something bad is going to happen," Vinnie whispered to Mandy.

25
00:01:45.894 --> 00:01:48.435
"How do you know?"

26
00:01:49.115 --> 00:01:49.835
asked Mandy.

27
00:01:49.855 --> 00:01:52.656
"What are you talking about?"

28
00:01:52.676 --> 00:01:56.258
"I can't believe you don't get it!"

29
00:01:56.818 --> 00:01:58.159
Vinnie nearly shouted.

30
00:01:58.179 --> 00:02:01.360
"She's Princess Anastasia!

31
00:02:02.112 --> 00:02:04.093
Don't you remember the movie we saw?"

32
00:02:05.835 --> 00:02:07.376
Mandy grabbed Vinnie's arm.

33
00:02:07.396 --> 00:02:09.737
"The Romanovs!"

34
00:02:10.398 --> 00:02:10.898
she said.

35
00:02:10.918 --> 00:02:13.259
"Now I remember.

36
00:02:14.160 --> 00:02:16.261
The whole family gets murdered.

37
00:02:17.983 --> 00:02:19.904
We have to do something!"

38
00:02:21.325 --> 00:02:23.486
The horror of it made Mandy cry.

39
00:02:25.768 --> 00:02:27.629
Vinnie held his sister's hands.

40
00:02:27.649 --> 00:02:33.277
"Mandy, we can't change history," he said sadly.

41
00:02:34.417 --> 00:02:38.499
At that moment, two men in military uniforms walked by.

42
00:02:39.779 --> 00:02:42.981
They were carrying a gold box on a red cushion.

43
00:02:44.421 --> 00:02:47.403
Nearby, some servants whispered in excitement.

44
00:02:48.623 --> 00:02:51.564
"That must be the new egg," said Vinnie.

45
00:02:52.865 --> 00:02:56.547
The men carried the box into the palace reception room.

46
00:02:57.747 --> 00:02:59.648
They left the door slightly open.

47
00:03:01.188 --> 00:03:03.069
Vinnie and Mandy peered through.

48
00:03:04.230 --> 00:03:08.312
In the reception room, the royal family stood near a small table.

49
00:03:09.653 --> 00:03:11.534
Anna Pavlova was there too.

50
00:03:12.654 --> 00:03:14.975
Rasputin stood next to the czarina.

51
00:03:16.356 --> 00:03:19.878
The czar took the box and pulled out a green colored egg.

52
00:03:19.898 --> 00:03:22.920
"It looks like a tree!"

53
00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:24.521
cried Anastasia.

54
00:03:25.941 --> 00:03:30.704
The egg was supported by a short stick and covered in leaves made of jade.

55
00:03:31.984 --> 00:03:34.145
The tree's fruit were colorful jewels.

56
00:03:35.585 --> 00:03:38.726
Vinnie took out the photo: it was glowing blue.

57
00:03:38.746 --> 00:03:40.946
"What's this?"

58
00:03:41.627 --> 00:03:45.128
said the czarina, touching a lever on the side of the egg.

59
00:03:46.328 --> 00:03:48.789
Suddenly, the top of the tree opened.

60
00:03:50.249 --> 00:03:53.750
A little bird popped out as a melody filled the room.

61
00:03:55.310 --> 00:03:56.311
Everyone clapped.

62
00:03:56.331 --> 00:03:59.492
"The photo!"

63
00:04:00.112 --> 00:04:01.072
Mandy whispered.

64
00:04:02.512 --> 00:04:04.694
The object in the photo was the bird.

65
00:04:05.815 --> 00:04:07.036
It was glowing red.

66
00:04:09.538 --> 00:04:14.061
Just as Mandy closed her eyes, she saw Anastasia wink at her.

67
00:04:15.403 --> 00:04:17.864
The children fell down the dark tunnel.

68
00:04:22.088 --> 00:04:25.471
The next thing they knew, they were home in the attic again.

69
00:04:26.872 --> 00:04:28.713
Mom stood in the doorway.

70
00:04:28.733 --> 00:04:30.314
"My eyes!

71
00:04:30.895 --> 00:04:31.976
What was that light?"

72
00:04:32.401 --> 00:04:33.082
she shouted.

73
00:04:34.345 --> 00:04:36.649
Vinnie and Mandy looked at each other.

74
00:04:38.012 --> 00:04:39.635
They were in trouble.
